      "section_id": "kohler-volume-3:p0321-p0324:s00:x00",
      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "            Familie: Ranuneulaceae.                Unterfamilie:             Helleboreae.       Tribus: Delphinioideae.            Gattung:\nDelphinium L.          Sekt: Staphisagria.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "分類：毛茛科，Helleboreae亞科，Delphinioideae族，Delphinium屬，Staphisagria組。",
      "evidence_indexes": [
        0
      ],
